## Server-Side Encryption

```java
// SSE-S3 (AWS managed keys — free)
PutObjectRequest req = PutObjectRequest.builder()
    .bucket(bucketName)
    .key(key)
    .serverSideEncryption(ServerSideEncryption.AES256)  // SSE-S3
    .build();

// SSE-KMS (Customer managed keys — auditable, FIPS compliant)
PutObjectRequest req = PutObjectRequest.builder()
    .bucket(bucketName)
    .key(key)
    .serverSideEncryption(ServerSideEncryption.AWS_KMS)
    .ssekmsKeyId("arn:aws:kms:...:key/xxx")  // your KMS key
    .build();
```

